[{"title":"醮夜同耑孙遨游邂逅何生索锦缠头辄解赠之同耑孙各赋一曲","author":"黎遂球","text":"头上销魂是锦缠，半余青鬓两行偏。\n观梅自爱香风薄，拭粉那缘玉汗鲜。\n醉里月倾三弄笛，秋馀寒浸一枝莲。\n相思海国堪同载，徐福何须更觅仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34668,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和家大人同饮欧子建苏季文谢伯子庞尔珍赏赵裕子水仙花有赋","author":"黎遂球","text":"金屋瑶台韵不孤，水衣莲曳雪为肤。\n雨馀叹出临天女，溪半閒来斗小姑。\n翠被粉胶双蝶梦，玉盘光散几鲛珠。\n描情胜有春风笔，尚忆罗虬九锡无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34669,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠刘子","author":"黎遂球","text":"莫向乾坤叹索居，只今谁复卯金如。\n人间鬼母啼中酒，天上神仙访读书。\n千家裙襦儒业尽，一昧灯火佛光馀。\n玄经著就谁堪问，笑我同君二十初。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34670,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得韩孟郁先生书却寄","author":"黎遂球","text":"驿使梅归腊正寒，尺书长跽慰加餐。\n交游小友惭称孔，国子先生信是韩。\n丰镐地开周社稷，桥门人领汉衣冠。\n相思辄复凭双鲤，六代陵园望气看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34671,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁卯春日陈行天梁未央婆塞戒各以诗见投赋答四首诸子于诃林禅堂受优 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"一落人间任有情，在家行径也何成。\n齑盐久以荤如素，草莽谁闻杀与生。\n短榻坐来蛙共语，好花持供佛堪盟。\n随缘却得安心罢，敢向空门更擅名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34672,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁卯春日陈行天梁未央婆塞戒各以诗见投赋答四首诸子于诃林禅堂受优 其二","author":"黎遂球","text":"万事沉浮共一觞，算来多是费肝肠。\n儿郎白面心相许，侠客青萍手自将。\n海内结交鱼腹烂，枕间言笑麝脐香。\n凭君欲问栖禅事，恰似游人却望乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34673,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁卯春日陈行天梁未央婆塞戒各以诗见投赋答四首诸子于诃林禅堂受优 其三","author":"黎遂球","text":"戟作须髯剑作眉，是非惟有自家知。\n狂来诗兴堪千首，悟到禅登證一枝。\n镜里夫妻閒共语，膝边兄弟无相嬉。\n思寻独笑迂顽甚，戒律惟同半偈持。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34674,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁卯春日陈行天梁未央婆塞戒各以诗见投赋答四首诸子于诃林禅堂受优 其四","author":"黎遂球","text":"一饮千缗断葛滕，醉眠谁道异为僧。\n粘泥柳絮飞初定，出水莲花染不曾。\n寂寞信同千顷月，暄炎消尽满山冰。\n生平懒作逢迎事，佞佛何妨说未能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34675,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫述答人","author":"黎遂球","text":"风雨潇潇更病中，隔帘从报落花红。\n束书高枕梦中梦，流水当门东复东。\n药臼自研忘味苦，蒯缑相伴笑心雄。\n孤居颇觉须眉好，那得逢人态转工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34676,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豫章舟中同黄虞六咏雪四首 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"笑挹琼浆入盏盈，对君疑是玉为京。\n四方屏幛开云母，七尺珊瑚立水晶。\n旧里素馨犹伴作，空床白练待书成。\n鸳雏睡煖今何处，镇日沙头未放晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34677,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豫章舟中同黄虞六咏雪四首 其二","author":"黎遂球","text":"万斛珍珠忽满船，醉来应得赠吟边。\n梅风梦绕银尊月，花雨晴飞玉镜天。\n楼阁千家红鸭亸，桥梁双影白龙眠。\n行歌岂用伤同调，前路长堪共着鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34678,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豫章舟中同黄虞六咏雪四首 其三","author":"黎遂球","text":"封却鸡声放晓迟，推蓬容易鬓成丝。\n如绵不煖扁舟梦，拭粉难描远岫眉。\n麈柄对谈那得辨，鹤裘端坐较相宜。\n同云亦作松花片，待鸟撩天雁字诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34679,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豫章舟中同黄虞六咏雪四首 其四","author":"黎遂球","text":"岂但浮云似白衣，诸峰寒瘦又寒肥。\n光欺兰烬三更后，舞乱梨花二月非。\n眼底琉璃看世界，毫梢珠玉佐閒挥。\n朝来高阁纷如许，疑见滕王蛱蝶飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34680,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胥舒城除夕","author":"黎遂球","text":"一盏灯花隔岁明，旅怀无地不关情。\n看春值过周瑜里，访古閒登刘信城。\n岁节尽从驴背度，特华差遣客愁轻。\n何因复听江南曲，疑是家园侣伴声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34681,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日晓渡濠梁","author":"黎遂球","text":"道傍停马独依依，谁问观鱼乐与非。\n日照大濠城影乱，雪残衰草路沙飞。\n篙师向晓齐迎渡，客子冲寒自着衣。\n回首故园歌舞节，风尘相逐愧轻肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34682,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏示当垆者","author":"黎遂球","text":"曾是青楼第一名，汗罗香腻染卿卿。\n鸦翎晓鬓和花掠，蝶翅春魂抱梦惊。\n巫雨散馀犹有赋，仙源寻得浪多情。\n于今欲火成光焰，自唱迦陵度五更。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34683,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕同左渔起黄虞六饮徐州殷秀才家秀才曾纠集义兵杀平妖贼","author":"黎遂球","text":"秃袖豪歌青夜寒，烛花重剪照阑干。\n尊前缘酒浇胸进，腰下青铜蚀血看。\n马影路傍霜气重，鸡声河上月光残。\n明朝又上长安道，细认须髯好跨鞍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34684,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安感述","author":"黎遂球","text":"共怀铅椠入神京，谁识终童愿清缨。\n颇有郁轮差自唱，每逢开阁愧多情。\n不才敢怨吾年少，抱恨谁怜主圣明。\n归去又应来万里，草茅偏动祝尧声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34685,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏杏花","author":"黎遂球","text":"看花初褪骕骦裘，尘静偏宜杏雨收。\n千树上林香带旭，数枝横店色如秋。\n全侵紫陌纷游骑，碎拂青帘认酒楼。\n欲置品题何所似，霞标高建赤城头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34686,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"都中有怀陈秋涛先生","author":"黎遂球","text":"为忆龙门笑语亲，长安长日望车尘。\n仙踪尽著黄金马，相国应推美玉人。\n砖冷万花閒赋署，路垂千柳系行津。\n何须尚著东山屐，丝竹丛中度一春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34687,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳前二日重过镜园同周彭冯诸子泛舟和玄度先生","author":"黎遂球","text":"相过长得恋衡门，尊酒中流好避喧。\n日落远林横树影，水平低岸长风痕。\n招寻伴侣乘秋兴，取次鱼虾伴晚餐。\n骚客又逢餐菊会，莫将渔父与深言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34688,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题荡云航二首 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"列树如蒲驾小舠，枕流还爱结巢高。\n科头夜夜眠银汉，洗耳时时入翠涛。\n寒玉万条共把钓，绿烟千顷任停篙。\n狂来拟沐咸池发，鼓枻谁能和楚骚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34689,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题荡云航二首 其二","author":"黎遂球","text":"乌鹊桥头锦缆牵，女牛求渡不论钱。\n林中自捲秋霞幔，天上浑如春水船。\n满载欲偷悬圃药，长歌堪采泰华莲。\n急催沽酒需金粟，更泊姮娥桂树边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34690,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日同区启图招姑苏刘元声元博昆仲暨修六若惺智海三上人小集云筏分赋元声","author":"黎遂球","text":"水榭刍盘更傍僧，自今新暑隔垂藤。\n尊前醉立连枝玉，门下清临一鉴冰。\n雨气任迷羊石路，夜谈犹记虎丘灯。\n当歌况是经年会，酒禁从他笑未能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34691,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花朝梁木公招待家大人同欧子建赵裕子戴安仲邝湛若诸公社集诃林千佛塔赋 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"剩有黄金布柳芽，空门春事兴偏加。\n斋逢社日难除酒，梦破佳晨便趁花。\n四海诗名谁敌国，十年交道只通家。\n披香坐遍虞园地，几度相随类彩霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34692,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花朝梁木公招待家大人同欧子建赵裕子戴安仲邝湛若诸公社集诃林千佛塔赋 其二","author":"黎遂球","text":"塔影亭亭落砚田，挥豪看似共耕烟。\n一千佛像同高会，九十春光已半边。\n纵饮莫营身外物，片言皆种舌根莲。\n禅门衣钵诗人派，此处从来共可传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34693,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答梁木公入社论诗之作","author":"黎遂球","text":"一春风雨对谈诗，笔墨长堪伴酒卮。\n念佛岂真吾贾岛，铸形难得尔钟期。\n须缘只字撚应断，帚以千金敝不辞。\n花阵鸟澜都作敌，莫于棋鼓笑偏师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34694,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶柬邓伯乔先生","author":"黎遂球","text":"石榴初破荔枝残，恶雨恶风行路难。\n葛巾漉酒去何日，麦粥长斋又一餐。\n酿蜜不疗寒士苦，醯鸡宁比腐儒酸。\n明朝得意好光景，卓锡泉头试月团。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34695,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘平子索作小景赠观上人时无缯具戏以点朱笔洒墨成之颇有别趣自题","author":"黎遂球","text":"黛色如回日，烟光尽带霞。\n不知挥洒意，沉醉綵毫花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34696,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳絮三者客舍晚坐走笔题歌者扇 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"落袖红知白，沾池重更轻。\n隔堤斜日澹，织月较分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34697,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳絮三者客舍晚坐走笔题歌者扇 其二","author":"黎遂球","text":"入夏愁无雪，先秋便有风。\n几堪特赠意，飘泊笑行踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34698,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳絮三者客舍晚坐走笔题歌者扇 其三","author":"黎遂球","text":"寂寂舞帘前，悠悠去远天。\n不妨团扇在，楼外听吟蝉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34699,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春花曲","author":"黎遂球","text":"烟如护架纱，风作并州剪。\n一夜尽装成，是谁香泪染。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34700,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自题浴石居","author":"黎遂球","text":"清居爱泉石，似此亦怡然。\n洗耳还高卧，巢山未费钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34701,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠人新姬二首 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"十四学弹筝，芙蓉旋双颊。\n对镜怜如花，缘何笑桃叶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34702,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠人新姬二首 其二","author":"黎遂球","text":"按拍坐君侧，珍珠一线长。\n歌喉本鹦鹉，赢得作鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34703,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜夜曲","author":"黎遂球","text":"出门人见郎，勿乱垂髫发。\n侬自与郎梳，照以阶前月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34704,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意三首 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"芳郭细柳丝，随风铺似织。\n新欢见旧欢，何缘得相识。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34705,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意三首 其二","author":"黎遂球","text":"欲采红莲花，未老心先苦。\n旧藉与新花，郎言都是好。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34706,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意三首 其三","author":"黎遂球","text":"寻春不见春，见郎在花底。\n本欲向郎言，知郎欲何以。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34707,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白团扇歌","author":"黎遂球","text":"赠郎白团扇，绣出双芙蓉。\n倘爱芙蓉娇，无徒弃秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34708,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲童曲","author":"黎遂球","text":"莲童双眼低，面白与侬似。\n折花赠莲童，是侬阿姑子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34709,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双行缠","author":"黎遂球","text":"绣带双行缠，临阶踏春草。\n风不展红裙，阿谁知是好。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34710,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下异","author":"黎遂球","text":"饮酒当尽醉，逍遥当及夜。\n西风送嫦娥，欣然面东嫁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34711,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"避暑三首 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"雨过雄鸡啼，竹阴何柳柳。\n山气日夕佳，陶然酌清酒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34712,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"避暑三首 其二","author":"黎遂球","text":"清池开谷文，荷花对明月。\n閒看秋水篇，肝肠沁如雪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34713,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"避暑三首 其三","author":"黎遂球","text":"劈荔水晶洁，折藕琉璃松。\n况复怀伊人，玉山坐松风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34714,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端前砚以火痣色为佳予得一方颇自珍爱因复记二十字","author":"黎遂球","text":"祖龙欲东行，骑山度溪水。\n鞭之血肉匀，割与管城子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34715,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈虎顺东皋诸景五首 其一 最胜楼","author":"黎遂球","text":"高楼锁翠微，仙子晚牵衣。\n时见山下人，往来如鸟飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34716,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈虎顺东皋诸景五首 其二 锦袍湾","author":"黎遂球","text":"每饮金龟酒，如游贺监湖。\n花下美人归，霞起儿童呼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34717,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈虎顺东皋诸景五首 其三 九龙井","author":"黎遂球","text":"神龙生九子，谁道不成龙。\n灵泉本在田，为雨疑乘风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34718,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈虎顺东皋诸景五首 其四 绿云堆","author":"黎遂球","text":"娇娘委高髻，午睡笼碧纱。\n平畴曳春烟，其中香者花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34719,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈虎顺东皋诸景五首 其五 佛冈","author":"黎遂球","text":"寒梅白如饭，咽之净肠腑。\n谁如金粟来，能游香积土。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34720,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉题斋壁二首 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"兴至撮襟成字，狂来散发长歌。\n五柳腰肢可惜，三闾醉醒如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34721,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉题斋壁二首 其二","author":"黎遂球","text":"庄生任呼牛马，介子不辨龙蛇。\n眼底乾坤悬行，身边花酒为家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34722,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园十首 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"莺儿学语不成歌，鸠妇频呼更若何。\n储得浊漻三百斛，冶游争奈雨云多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34723,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园十首 其二","author":"黎遂球","text":"经过小榭绿池东，坐见封姨剪落红。\n为听茗涛谈不起，忘教垂幔障芳丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34724,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园十首 其三","author":"黎遂球","text":"东家有钱门早关，窗舍南邻复不閒。\n明月满天消不得，远将朋伴探花还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34725,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园十首 其四","author":"黎遂球","text":"自写花书到仲春，閒寻历日勘佳辰。\n分明试得新方好，特选根苗教别人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34726,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园十首 其五","author":"黎遂球","text":"青梅□□李如珠，雨过游蜂上下孤。\n才省瓣红粘破网，短檐西向骂蜘蛛。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34727,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园十首 其六","author":"黎遂球","text":"夭桃何分嫁游丝，飞却犹教曳片时。\n白日笑从窗外过，篆烟如丝不能羁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34728,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园十首 其七","author":"黎遂球","text":"怪石玲珑二寸馀，每怜新浴试罗襦。\n平头奴子知珍重，特拜花房小尚书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34729,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园十首 其八","author":"黎遂球","text":"青山无限隔春城，拟作高楼睥睨平。\n多泼墨香临入画，近看云树远看晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34730,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园十首 其九","author":"黎遂球","text":"佞佛新从破衲僧，小斋长自供明灯。\n閒时酒盏都堪却，只是花前□不能。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34731,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园十首 其十","author":"黎遂球","text":"吴绫裁作道书装，砚石瓶花列半床。\n近日片肠清冷甚，信饶春兴入诗囊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34732,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏木笔花","author":"黎遂球","text":"画柳成眉叶叶工，一枝高写晚霞红。\n青春自有如掾在，何事江郎斗梦中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34733,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春江作","author":"黎遂球","text":"水面杨枝受小舟，桃花东下鲤鱼浮。\n春江欲钓无聊赖，百尺游丝月作钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34734,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋千词","author":"黎遂球","text":"院角秋千是妾家，每于摇处挽红纱。\n侍儿惯逐香风底，拾得钗钿并落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34735,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉送王父母张玉笥老师入觐二首 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"将琴携鹤隘通衢，竹马童儿五裤纡。\n忆得使君才到日，木棉开尽叹无襦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34736,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉送王父母张玉笥老师入觐二首 其二","author":"黎遂球","text":"东南端此赖平安，民力深知事事难。\n天子芳虚前席问，殿前应正触邪冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34737,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒榻病馀笑目前景物都无可咏因戏作天上宫词十首 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"蓬山仙女学骑龙，笑并秦娥度海东。\n约看回翁新弟子，袖间笼着小桃红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34738,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]